            "content": "About Talo testing 123"
          },
          {
            "id": "about-p1",
            "build": "auto",
            "showIn": "both",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": "Talo Engine is a digital engineering consultancy and studio specialising in MEP engineering, with a broader focus on digital design and asset creation. Talo optimises the creation of industry-standard drawings, technical details, and digital models, delivering precise, project-specific outputs across a range of technical disciplines."
          },
          {
            "id": "about-p2",
            "build": "auto",
            "showIn": "both",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": "Founded by Natcha Kucita, an MEP/BIM engineer with over a decade of experience delivering residential and commercial projects across the UK, Talo Engine combines engineering expertise, BIM proficiency, and emerging technologies to advance design workflows and technical delivery."
          }
        ],
